<h1>About Junior Golf Wales</h1>
<p>Before this site, finding junior golf events across Wales meant checking a
handful of different club websites, county association pages, and Golf
Empire's booking system — with no single place that showed everything at
once, specifically for junior players.</p>

<p>Junior Golf Wales pulls together county opens, national tours, and club
competitions for boys and girls, across North, Mid and South Wales, in one
searchable place. It's free for clubs to list an event, and free for parents
to browse.</p>

<p>The site is independently run. If you organise junior golf events in
Wales and want yours listed, <a href="/submit-event">submit it here</a> —
or get in touch via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

